# Pairs with ScopeAgreement. Production before #5620: nothing checked which
# scope owned the bare id, so identical content captured in a second scope
# published under it, over the first scope's backup.
MODULE: ScopeAgreementIgnoresOwner
TARGET: ScopeAgreement
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claim ignores the scope that owns the bare id
PERTURBS: Resolve

--- FIND
             \/ Owner \notin {"none", s}
--- REPLACE
             \* MUTATION: the owner is not consulted.
             \/ FALSE
--- END
